    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2700\"><em data-start=\"2686\" data-end=\"2700\">(10th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"2702\" data-end=\"2742\">You bless a site or community for a day.</p><p data-start=\"2744\" data-end=\"2779\">Choose one infrastructure blessing:</p><ul data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2902\"><li data-start=\"2781\" data-end=\"2806\"><p data-start=\"2783\" data-end=\"2806\">Food supply stabilizes.</p></li><li data-start=\"2807\" data-end=\"2832\"><p data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2832\">Shelter becomes secure.</p></li><li data-start=\"2833\" data-end=\"2848\"><p data-start=\"2835\" data-end=\"2848\">Calm spreads.</p></li><li data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2869\"><p data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2869\">Structures repair.</p></li><li data-start=\"2870\" data-end=\"2902\"><p data-start=\"2872\" data-end=\"2902\">Safe passage becomes reliable.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2904\" data-end=\"2955\">This is not combat power.<br data-start=\"2929\" data-end=\"2932\" />This is sustainability.</p><h3 data-start=\"2957\" data-end=\"2965\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"2966\" data-end=\"3011\">Spend 1\u20132 Surge (scale by scope).</p><h3 data-start=\"3013\" data-end=\"3022\">Scope</h3><p data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3103\">Blessings operate narratively within reason; they do not invalidate natural law.</p><h3 data-start=\"3105\" data-end=\"3117\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"3118\" data-end=\"3187\">Communities may begin expecting miracles instead of building systems.</p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
